Master index of every requirements source under this folder.

Purpose: a single place to enumerate everything that could go stale, for a human or a skill
(`/book:check-sources all`) to walk - and the ONE place every live link is kept (LINKS, below). Each
folder's read-me.txt keeps only its versioning rule and its "Last checked" line.

This folder is READ-ONLY for everyone except the book:check-sources skill: a file that is already
here is never edited. A new capture is a new file.

Format per entry: local path -> what it is -> versioning.

Cadence: at most ONE capture per source per week. A V<n> file is never overwritten, a tracker's
superseded copy moves into backup/ first, and old captures stay where they are.

